    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The sports team from Colorado entered the playoff series weakened by the loss of key personnel, a circumstance that ultimately led to a disorder-triggered coaching change. The new coach, a professional hired as a mid-season coaching hire, managed a strong finish and coached playoff series wins, yet the team's defensive performance collapsed under sustained pressure. In Game 4, the conference final winner enforced dominance, completing the sweep and advancing to the championship round, a clear demonstration of superior game strategy.",
